const countResources=roots=>{const g=new Set(),m=new Set(),t=new Set();let meshes=0;for(const root of roots)root?.traverse(o=>{if(o.isMesh)meshes++;if(o.geometry)g.add(o.geometry);for(const mat of o.material?(Array.isArray(o.material)?o.material:[o.material]):[]){m.add(mat);for(const value of Object.values(mat))if(value?.isTexture)t.add(value);}});return{meshes,geometries:g.size,materials:m.size,textures:t.size};};
export function createBoatPresentation({scene,player,model,poser,sourceCamera=null,getMood=()=>({id:'day'}),reduced:reducedPreference=false,clearInput=()=>{}}){let live=null,disposed=false;const quarantined=[],actorPosition=new THREE.Vector3();
 function begin(route,origin,{motionFree=false}={}){if(disposed||live||quarantined.length)throw Error('Boat presentation already owned');clearInput();const start={x:player.position.x,y:player.position.y,z:player.position.z,yaw:player.rotation.y},visibility=[],modelPosition=model.position.clone(),modelRotation=model.rotation.clone(),playerRotation=player.rotation.clone(),originVisible=origin.root.visible,originDock=boatEndpointContext(origin,route.from).dock,parkedVisible=originDock.boat.root.visible;player.traverse(o=>visibility.push([o,o.visible]));let boat=null,ocean=null,camera=null,wake=null;try{boat=createBoatView();wake=createBoatWake();camera=createBoatCamera();ocean=createOceanView({camera:camera.camera,centerX:0,coastZ:-80,mood:getMood()?.id});ocean.root.name='transport.ocean';scene.add(boat.root,ocean.root,wake.root);ocean.root.visible=false;live={route,origin,next:null,originDisposed:false,start,from:endpointLocal(route.from,boatLocalPoint(origin,scene,route.from,start)),originDock,originPin:originDock.pin?.(),visibility,modelPosition:model.position.clone(),modelRotation:model.rotation.clone(),boat,ocean,camera,wake,phase:'boarding',motionFree,committed:false,actorFrame:null,vessel:null};live.approach=createBoardingApproach(live.from,endpointLocal(route.from,route.from.target.at));originDock.setParkedVisible(false);player.children.forEach(o=>{if(o!==model)o.visible=false;});clearInput();applyFrame(motionFree?'motion-free-wait':'boarding',0,{boardTime:0});}catch(error){live?.originPin?.();boat?.dispose();ocean?.dispose();camera?.dispose();wake?.dispose();live=null;player.position.set(start.x,start.y,start.z);player.rotation.copy(playerRotation);try{poser.reset();}catch{}model.position.copy(modelPosition);model.rotation.copy(modelRotation);for(const[o,v]of visibility)o.visible=v;origin.root.visible=originVisible;originDock.setParkedVisible(parkedVisible);throw error;}}
 function validateArrival(next){const f=live;if(!f)throw Error('Boat presentation cancelled');const e=f.route.to,context=boatEndpointContext(next,e),world=boatEndpointWorld(next,e),global=next?.collisionWorld?.()??next?.residents?.collisionWorld?.()??(next?.endpointContext?resolveLocation({roomId:e.roomId,spawnId:e.spawnId})?.runtimeRoom:ROOMS[e.roomId]),landing=boatScenePoint(next,scene,e,e.landing),target=boatScenePoint(next,scene,e,e.target.at);if(!next?.root||!context.dock?.ready||!canMove(world,e.landing.x,e.landing.z,.66)||!canMove(world,e.target.at.x,e.target.at.z,.66)||!canMove(global,landing.x,landing.z,.66)||!canMove(global,target.x,target.z,.66))throw Error('Boat destination landing is not ready');return true;}
 function prepareArrival(next){next.prepareEndpoint?.(live?.route.to.roomId);validateArrival(next);live.next=next;live.nextDock=boatEndpointContext(next,live.route.to).dock;live.nextPin=live.nextDock.pin?.();live.nextDock.setParkedVisible(false);return boatScenePoint(next,scene,live.route.to,{...live.route.to.landing,y:.05});}
 function commitArrival(next){if(!live||live.next!==next)throw Error('Boat destination was not prepared');live.committed=true;live.origin.root.visible=false;next.root.visible=true;live.ocean.root.visible=false;applyFrame(live.motionFree?'motion-free-arrived':'arriving',0,{boardTime:BOAT.boardDuration});}
 function boardFrame(f,time){const a=f.approach;return a&&time<a.duration?sampleBoardingApproach(a,time):sampleBoarding(a?.to??f.from,Math.max(0,time-(a?.duration??0)));}
 function applyFrame(phase,elapsed,{boardTime=elapsed,reduced=reducedPreference,paused=false,gangwayAmount=null}={}){const f=live;if(!f||paused)return;const delta=phase==='cruise'&&f.phase===phase?Math.max(0,elapsed-(f.lastElapsed??elapsed)):0;f.lastElapsed=elapsed;f.lastBoardTime=boardTime;f.phase=phase;let e=f.committed?f.route.to:f.route.from,vessel=sampleVessel(phase,elapsed,{swell:!reduced&&!f.motionFree}),actor={x:0,y:BOAT.seatRootY,z:vessel.z,yaw:0,pose:1};
  if(['boarding','cancelling','reopening'].includes(phase)){actor=boardFrame(f,boardTime);vessel={...vessel,z:0,gangway:phase==='reopening'?boatEase(elapsed/.8):1};}
  else if(phase==='disembarking'||phase==='walkoff'){actor=sampleBoatExit(endpointLocal(e,e.landing),elapsed+(phase==='walkoff'?BOAT.boardDuration:0));vessel={...vessel,z:0,gangway:1};}
  else if(phase==='motion-free-arrived'){actor={...endpointLocal(e,e.landing),y:.05,pose:0};vessel={...vessel,z:0,gangway:1};}
  else if(phase==='motion-free-wait'){vessel={...vessel,z:0,gangway:1};actor={...actor,z:0};}
  if(phase==='cruise'){f.origin.root.visible=false;f.ocean.root.visible=true;e=f.route.from;f.ocean.update(delta,{paused,reduced:reduced||f.motionFree,mood:getMood()?.id,camera:f.camera.camera,centerX:boatScenePoint(f.origin,scene,e,endpointWorld(e,vessel)).x});}else{f.ocean.root.visible=false;if(!f.committed)f.origin.root.visible=true;}
  if(Number.isFinite(gangwayAmount))vessel.gangway=gangwayAmount;const owner=f.committed?f.next:f.origin,hull=boatScenePoint(owner,scene,e,{...endpointWorld(e,vessel),y:vessel.y??0}),p=boatScenePoint(owner,scene,e,endpointWorld(e,actor));if(actor.walk>0&&actor.checkApproach!==false){const local=endpointWorld(e,actor),world=owner.collisionWorld?.()??owner.residents?.collisionWorld?.();if(!canMove(boatEndpointWorld(owner,e),local.x,local.z,.66)||world&&!canMove(world,p.x,p.z,.66))throw Error('Boarding approach became occupied');}f.boat.setFrame(hull);
  const seated=['retracting','departing','cruise','arriving','deploying','motion-free-wait'].includes(phase);
  if(seated){f.boat.root.updateMatrix();actorPosition.set(0,BOAT.seatRootY,0).applyMatrix4(f.boat.root.matrix);player.position.copy(actorPosition);player.quaternion.copy(f.boat.root.quaternion);}else{player.position.set(p.x,p.y,p.z);player.rotation.set(0,p.yaw,0);}
  f.wake.update({x:hull.x,z:hull.z,yaw:hull.yaw,speed:vessel.speed,time:phase==='cruise'?5+elapsed:phase==='arriving'?13+elapsed:elapsed,reverse:vessel.reverse,reduced:reduced||f.motionFree,paused});model.position.set(0,0,0);model.rotation.set(0,0,0);if(actor.walk>0)poser.setPose('run',actor.walk,actor.walkTime);else poser.setPose('seesaw',p.pose);f.endpoint=e;f.actorFrame=actor;f.vessel=vessel;f.paused=paused;f.reduced=reduced;
 }
 function fit(width,height,options={}){const f=live;if(!f)return null;
  const sea=['departing','cruise','arriving'].includes(f.phase),framing=sea?(f.phase==='departing'?boatEase((f.lastElapsed??0)/1.2):f.phase==='arriving'?1-boatEase(((f.lastElapsed??0)-3.8)/1.2):1):0;
  // Gradually give the stern breathing room as the boat leaves, without a
  // camera cut at cruise or sacrificing the existing compact boarding view.
  const a=f.actorFrame,bounds=framing&&a?[[-1.6-.3*framing,1.6+.3*framing,-.3-.05*framing,.8,a.z-2.65-.25*framing,a.z+1.25+1.85*framing],[a.x-.61,a.x+.61,a.y,a.y+1.584,a.z-.62,a.z+.62]]:null;
  const camera=f.camera.fit(width,height,{bounds,...boatScenePoint(f.committed?f.next:f.origin,scene,f.endpoint,{...f.endpoint.berth,y:f.endpoint.berth.y??0}),actor:f.actorFrame,...options});if(sourceCamera?.isOrthographicCamera&&!f.motionFree){const amount=['boarding','cancelling'].includes(f.phase)?boatEase((f.lastBoardTime??0)/1.2):f.phase==='walkoff'?1-boatEase((f.lastElapsed-2.8)/1.2):1;if(amount<1){camera.position.lerp(sourceCamera.position,1-amount);camera.quaternion.slerp(sourceCamera.quaternion,1-amount);for(const key of['left','right','top','bottom'])camera[key]=camera[key]*amount+(sourceCamera[key]/sourceCamera.zoom)*(1-amount);camera.updateProjectionMatrix();camera.updateMatrixWorld(true);}}return camera;}
 function release({destination=false}={}){const f=live;if(!f)return{settled:quarantined.length===0,cleanupComplete:quarantined.length===0};const errors=[],attempt=(fn,{retry=false}={})=>{try{fn();return true;}catch(error){if(retry){try{fn();return true;}catch(second){errors.push(second);return false;}}errors.push(error);return false;}};let cleanupComplete=true;
  try{attempt(clearInput,{retry:true});if(destination===null){cleanupComplete=false;quarantined.push({view:f.origin,next:f.next,reason:'Host ownership is unknown'});}else{const target=destination?boatScenePoint(f.next,scene,f.route.to,{...f.route.to.landing,y:.05}):f.start;
   if(destination){attempt(()=>{f.origin.root.visible=false;f.origin.root.removeFromParent();});if(!f.originDisposed){cleanupComplete=false;quarantined.push({view:f.origin,root:f.origin.root,reason:'Origin disposal did not return successfully'});}attempt(()=>{if(f.next.root.parent!==scene)scene.add(f.next.root);f.next.root.visible=true;f.nextDock.setParkedVisible(true);});}
   else attempt(()=>{f.origin.root.visible=true;f.originDock.setParkedVisible(true);f.nextDock?.setParkedVisible(true);});
   attempt(()=>player.position.set(target.x,target.y,target.z),{retry:true});attempt(()=>player.rotation.set(0,target.yaw,0),{retry:true});attempt(()=>poser.reset(),{retry:true});attempt(()=>model.position.copy(f.modelPosition),{retry:true});attempt(()=>model.rotation.copy(f.modelRotation),{retry:true});for(const[o,v]of f.visibility)attempt(()=>o.visible=v);}
  }finally{attempt(()=>f.originPin?.());attempt(()=>f.nextPin?.());for(const owned of[f.boat,f.ocean,f.camera,f.wake]){if(!attempt(()=>owned.dispose()))cleanupComplete=false;attempt(()=>owned.root?.removeFromParent());}live=null;}
  if(errors.length)quarantined.push({reason:'Presentation restoration or owned cleanup failed',errors});return{settled:errors.length===0&&cleanupComplete,cleanupComplete,errors:errors.map(e=>String(e.message??e))};
 }
 return{begin,get boardDuration(){return BOAT.boardDuration+(live?.approach?.duration??0);},prepareArrival,validateArrival,confirmOriginDisposed(){if(live)live.originDisposed=true;},commitArrival,applyFrame,fit,release,get camera(){return live?.camera.camera??null;},get ownedRoots(){return live?[live.boat.root,live.ocean.root,live.wake.root]:[];},snapshot(){const f=live;return f?{phase:f.phase,committed:f.committed,originalActor:player.uuid,originalModel:model.uuid,actorParent:player.parent?.uuid,actorUnderDisposableRoot:player.parent===f.origin.root||player.parent===f.next?.root||player.parent===f.ocean.root,resources:countResources([f.boat.root,f.ocean.root,f.wake.root]),peakVisibleWorlds:[f.origin.root,f.next?.root].filter(Boolean).length,ocean:f.ocean.snapshot(),wake:f.wake.snapshot(),position:player.position.toArray()}:quarantined.length?{active:false,controlledFailure:true,quarantined:quarantined.length}:null;},dispose(){if(disposed)return;release({destination:!!live?.committed});disposed=true;}};
}
